# TicketIQ Automatic Interview Documentation & PDF Sync Rule

This project is built by a student preparing for campus placements and technical interviews. Every engineering choice must be documented so the user can defend it during technical interviews.

## Trigger Conditions
Whenever the agent completes:
- A new endpoint or service in FastAPI
- An ML experiment, training script, or data preprocessing step
- A database schema update, migration, or vector index operation
- A LangChain prompt/chain modification or LLM integration
- A major bug fix or architectural optimization
- A phase completion milestone

## Required Actions

### 1. Update `docs/interview_knowledge_journal.md`
Append a new entry under `## 4. Continuous Update Log (Phase-by-Phase)` using this exact structure:

```markdown
### [YYYY-MM-DD] — <Feature or Component Name>
- **What Was Implemented**: <1-2 sentences on code written, endpoints created, or models trained>
- **Engineering / Math Rationale**: <Why this choice was made mathematically or architecturally; loss functions, asymptotic complexity, or system constraints>
- **Trade-Offs Considered**: <Alternative A vs Alternative B, and why A was chosen>
- **Interview Question & Defense**:
  - *Q*: "<What the interviewer will ask about this change>"
  - *A*: "<The exact, crisp 30-second response demonstrating engineering maturity>"
- **Metrics & Numbers**: <e.g., Latency, Macro-F1, RAM footprint, Test coverage percentage>
```

If the change impacts one of the core foundational decisions, update Section 1 and Section 2 of `docs/interview_knowledge_journal.md` as well.

### 2. Automatically Rebuild HTML & PDFs
Run the documentation compiler:
```bash
python3 scripts/build_docs_and_pdfs.py
```
This ensures that:
- `docs/pdf/07_interview_knowledge_journal.pdf` is generated.
- `docs/pdf/TicketIQ_Complete_Guide.pdf` is updated with the new interview knowledge.
- The interactive Web Reader at `docs/index.html` reflects the live changes.

### 3. Report to User
At the end of the turn, explicitly notify the user:
- What new interview question and defense was added to their `interview_knowledge_journal.md`.
- That the PDF and interactive Web Reader have been re-compiled and are ready for review.
